From db45892e6df73147dbdc281b62483528227d8124 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1vivy <1vivy@tutanota.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 22:00:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 09/24] oplus-fwk: add Osense ABI stubs (BgRunning +
 unregister)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Camera app calls startBackgroundRunning / stopBackgroundRunning /
unregisterEventCallback at startup; without these the oplus-fwk boot jar
throws NoSuchMethodError and camera init fails. Add no-op stubs (same
pattern as the existing OsenseResEventClient skeleton) so the camera
stack boots cleanly on LineageOS.

Keeps both startBackgroundRunning overloads (BgRunningCallback and
OsenseEventCallback) to satisfy either OEM descriptor.

(cherry picked from commit a8f4628d3e51f3fc3bde2e9cff764db3f882bf74)
Change-Id: I6996c68691dd7e649e09987ff4717a4ec605bbc3

Conflict resolution: BgRunning start/stop already base-provided by bd0e44d0 (auto-merge duplicated them; deduped); kept only the residual unregisterEventCallback(OsenseEventCallback) member per the ledger PARTIAL note.

Ledger: hardware_oplus.md Accepted Group B row 2 (a8f4628d)
Stub-matrix: task-9-stub-inventory.md row K12 — consumer: OEM camera/gallery unregister path; location: member patch on base OsenseResEventClient.java
Change-Id: Ib77c7876a04e3ced8625e83557620302a4113127
---
 oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/osense/OsenseResEventClient.java | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/osense/OsenseResEventClient.java b/oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/osense/OsenseResEventClient.java
index 55a6b911..e59c008f 100644
--- a/oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/osense/OsenseResEventClient.java
+++ b/oplus-fwk/src/com/oplus/osense/OsenseResEventClient.java
@@ -25,6 +25,10 @@ public class OsenseResEventClient {
         return 0;
     }
 
+    public int unregisterEventCallback(OsenseEventCallback callback) {
+        return 0;
+    }
+
     public void requestSceneAction(Bundle bundle) {
         return;
     }
